1
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,800
"Blue Lips"

2
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:13,800
(Episode 14)

3
00:01:20,320 --> 00:01:21,020
What's wrong?

4
00:01:21,119 --> 00:01:22,119
Something on your mind?

5
00:01:22,639 --> 00:01:23,639
No.

6
00:01:23,980 --> 00:01:24,980
I just feel like...

7
00:01:25,820 --> 00:01:27,380
my sister has been acting weird lately.

8
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,480
Weird how?

9
00:01:29,619 --> 00:01:30,820
The test results came back.

10
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,280
It's not about the tests.

11
00:01:34,079 --> 00:01:35,079
It's...

12
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:38,200
The way she's been talking the
past couple of days is a bit strange.

13
00:01:38,340 --> 00:01:39,340
Do you think...

14
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,320
Do you think she found out?

15
00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:45,280
I don't think so.

16
00:01:47,579 --> 00:01:49,300
You know what she told me this morning?

17
00:01:51,059 --> 00:01:53,460
Something like, "Can't you
two be apart for even a second?"

18
00:01:54,199 --> 00:01:55,219
I just get the feeling...

19
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:56,719
She's hinting at something.

20
00:01:57,519 --> 00:01:58,980
So, while I was away...

21
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:00,420
What were you up to?

22
00:02:02,179 --> 00:02:02,659
Me?

23
00:02:02,900 --> 00:02:03,900
Nothing much.

24
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:06,039
I mean, when I was in Fengzhou...

25
00:02:06,559 --> 00:02:07,856
When you weren't with
your sister during the day...

26
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:08,880
Where did you go?

27
00:02:09,579 --> 00:02:10,599
I was, of course...

28
00:02:11,099 --> 00:02:12,179
Studying on my own.

29
00:02:12,820 --> 00:02:13,820
I just...

30
00:02:15,980 --> 00:02:17,619
Was I acting too obvious?

31
00:02:20,340 --> 00:02:21,420
I wouldn't know about that.

32
00:02:21,659 --> 00:02:22,659
It just feels like...

33
00:02:23,099 --> 00:02:24,139
You're really into me.

34
00:02:25,719 --> 00:02:26,860
Don't flatter yourself.

35
00:02:28,119 --> 00:02:29,319
What else did your sister say?

36
00:02:31,659 --> 00:02:32,440
She asked me...

37
00:02:32,539 --> 00:02:33,699
What I thought of you.

38
00:02:34,239 --> 00:02:35,239
And what did you say?

39
00:02:37,920 --> 00:02:39,500
I said you're pretty great.

40
00:02:40,619 --> 00:02:41,320
And...

41
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:42,960
Reliable.

42
00:02:44,539 --> 00:02:45,539
Things like that.

43
00:02:47,599 --> 00:02:49,340
Actually, your sister is incredibly smart.

44
00:02:50,099 --> 00:02:51,099
Shixian.

45
00:02:51,579 --> 00:02:53,579
I think you should take a
look when you have time.

46
00:02:53,820 --> 00:02:56,300
Once your sister gets better, we
should go somewhere on a trip.

47
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,579
Let's find somewhere warm.

48
00:02:58,920 --> 00:03:01,780
We can bask in the sun
and listen to music every day.

49
00:03:03,519 --> 00:03:04,876
Eat and drink to our hearts' content.

50
00:03:04,900 --> 00:03:06,020
Just really enjoy ourselves.

51
00:03:06,519 --> 00:03:08,599
Make up for all the
hardships of the past few years.

52
00:03:12,559 --> 00:03:13,559
Tell me...

53
00:03:15,059 --> 00:03:16,440
Will that day really come?

54
00:03:19,539 --> 00:03:20,860
It definitely will.

55
00:04:31,239 --> 00:04:32,099
What is this?
It's all crumpled.

56
00:04:37,219 --> 00:04:38,219
Shixian.

57
00:04:39,820 --> 00:04:40,820
Go and check...

58
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,800
If the wedding photos we took with
my sister have been developed yet.

59
00:04:45,099 --> 00:04:46,099
Okay.

60
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:47,460
Sis.

61
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:49,299
Can't we just call the photo studio...

62
00:04:49,300 --> 00:04:51,000
To confirm something like this?

63
00:04:52,119 --> 00:04:53,759
Just go. I'll keep an eye on things here.

64
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:55,519
Hurry up.

65
00:04:56,099 --> 00:04:57,099
Fine.

66
00:04:57,260 --> 00:04:57,699
Sis.

67
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,920
I'm heading out then.

68
00:05:05,559 --> 00:05:06,559
Take care.

69
00:05:10,059 --> 00:05:11,059
Teng Mo.

70
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,480
Come sit down.

71
00:05:19,880 --> 00:05:20,980
You probably know...

72
00:05:21,780 --> 00:05:23,018
I sent Shixian away...

73
00:05:23,019 --> 00:05:24,579
Because I have something to say to you.

74
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,000
Go ahead, Sis.

75
00:05:30,599 --> 00:05:31,619
Lately...

76
00:05:31,760 --> 00:05:34,840
You and Shixian have been taking
turns at the hospital to look after me.

77
00:05:35,260 --> 00:05:37,220
What exactly is the
relationship between you two?

78
00:05:39,619 --> 00:05:40,619
We're...

79
00:05:42,760 --> 00:05:44,280
I won't beat around the bush.

80
00:05:45,159 --> 00:05:46,500
Shixian likes you.

81
00:05:47,820 --> 00:05:48,820
Did you know that?

82
00:05:51,179 --> 00:05:52,400
We're, well...

83
00:05:52,760 --> 00:05:53,800
We get along really well.

84
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:56,280
Like kindred spirits.

85
00:05:58,480 --> 00:06:00,160
I'm not talking about that kind of liking.

86
00:06:01,260 --> 00:06:02,940
I mean liking you as a lover.

87
00:06:03,940 --> 00:06:04,940
What about you?

88
00:06:05,179 --> 00:06:06,219
Do you like him?

89
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:17,000
I do.

90
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,659
As a lover.

91
00:06:23,699 --> 00:06:25,195
Wanting to spend the
rest of my life with him.

92
00:06:25,219 --> 00:06:26,820
Growing old together, that kind of love.

93
00:06:42,860 --> 00:06:44,980
You know our family's financial situation.

94
00:06:45,420 --> 00:06:47,840
We're heavily in debt
because of my illness.

95
00:06:50,239 --> 00:06:51,279
If you two are together...

96
00:06:51,420 --> 00:06:52,718
For a very long time to come...

97
00:06:52,719 --> 00:06:54,500
life is going to be tough.

98
00:06:55,280 --> 00:06:56,280
Are you...

99
00:06:56,440 --> 00:06:57,739
mentally prepared for all this?

100
00:06:58,159 --> 00:06:59,159
It's fine, Sis.

101
00:06:59,239 --> 00:07:00,679
My family is doing okay financially.

102
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:02,019
And I have my own savings.

103
00:07:02,500 --> 00:07:03,500
Don't worry.

104
00:07:04,420 --> 00:07:05,420
Family...

105
00:07:06,380 --> 00:07:08,239
Does your family know about you two?

106
00:07:12,940 --> 00:07:13,940
No.

107
00:07:15,539 --> 00:07:16,119
Will they...

108
00:07:16,500 --> 00:07:18,179
approve of you two being together?

109
00:07:20,579 --> 00:07:21,979
Even though my parents are older...

110
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:24,560
Getting them to accept it...

111
00:07:25,619 --> 00:07:27,280
Of course it won't be easy.

112
00:07:30,500 --> 00:07:31,500
But I'm determined.

113
00:07:32,079 --> 00:07:34,400
I'm determined to prove myself to them.

114
00:07:34,940 --> 00:07:36,480
So they can give us their blessing.

115
00:07:38,579 --> 00:07:39,579
Teng Mo.

116
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:41,880
I hope you keep your word.

117
00:07:42,659 --> 00:07:45,599
Shixian's life over the past
twenty years has been far too hard.

118
00:07:46,400 --> 00:07:48,360
I don't want him to get hurt.

119
00:07:49,179 --> 00:07:50,800
I hope you'll protect him.

120
00:07:52,500 --> 00:07:54,740
I'll do everything in my
power to take good care of him.

121
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,260
Sis, does this mean you approve?

122
00:08:01,039 --> 00:08:03,119
If I had more time...

123
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:05,300
I might have objected.

124
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:08,519
Not because you're not
good enough, of course.

125
00:08:09,539 --> 00:08:11,380
But because two men being together...

126
00:08:12,239 --> 00:08:13,579
Is truly not easy.

127
00:08:14,260 --> 00:08:15,819
The criticism and judgment you'll face...

128
00:08:15,820 --> 00:08:17,680
Will be far more than you can imagine.

129
00:08:18,939 --> 00:08:20,300
Since I won't be by his side...

130
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:22,779
I don't want him to suffer such grievances.

131
00:08:25,279 --> 00:08:27,000
But it's his life, after all.

132
00:08:27,659 --> 00:08:29,260
Even though I'm his sister...

133
00:08:29,819 --> 00:08:31,880
I can't make decisions for him.

134
00:08:33,220 --> 00:08:34,380
All I can say is...

135
00:08:34,819 --> 00:08:36,779
Maybe this is all for the best.

136
00:08:37,819 --> 00:08:38,819
Rest assured, Sis.

137
00:08:39,100 --> 00:08:41,920
I promise I will never let
him come to any harm.

138
00:08:44,939 --> 00:08:46,319
Actually, I can tell...

139
00:08:46,939 --> 00:08:49,760
Shixian really, really likes you.

140
00:08:51,119 --> 00:08:52,220
This kid...

141
00:08:52,779 --> 00:08:54,640
He can have a bad temper sometimes.

142
00:08:55,039 --> 00:08:56,159
And he's impulsive.

143
00:08:57,119 --> 00:08:58,699
But he's a good kid.

144
00:08:59,359 --> 00:09:00,840
And he's very devoted.

145
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:05,020
I hope you'll be patient with him.

146
00:09:06,619 --> 00:09:07,899
After I'm gone...

147
00:09:08,319 --> 00:09:10,100
I'll leave him in your care.

148
00:09:12,859 --> 00:09:13,899
Lately...

149
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:16,179
Everything you've done for Shixian...

150
00:09:16,180 --> 00:09:17,460
I've seen it all.

151
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:21,100
It's exactly because you're here...

152
00:09:24,300 --> 00:09:26,100
That I can let go with peace of mind.

153
00:09:27,239 --> 00:09:29,640
And safely leave Shixian in your hands.

154
00:09:33,420 --> 00:09:34,420
Sis.

155
00:09:35,479 --> 00:09:36,500
Don't say that.

156
00:09:37,260 --> 00:09:39,340
I will treat Shixian well
for the rest of my life.

157
00:09:44,020 --> 00:09:45,100
Don't spoil him too much.

158
00:09:47,140 --> 00:09:48,960
You'll be the one who suffers in the end.

159
00:09:50,699 --> 00:09:52,260
I... I don't mind suffering.

160
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,840
And I'm not afraid of hardship.

161
00:09:54,859 --> 00:09:56,220
I just want him to be okay.

162
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:58,840
Okay.

163
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:00,819
I'm a bit tired.

164
00:10:01,359 --> 00:10:02,359
I want to rest.

165
00:10:02,859 --> 00:10:03,859
Then...

166
00:10:04,279 --> 00:10:05,300
I'll head out.

167
00:11:28,239 --> 00:11:29,439
I'll stay here and keep watch.

168
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:31,120
Why don't you go home first?

169
00:11:31,359 --> 00:11:32,719
I'll call you if anything happens.

170
00:11:34,119 --> 00:11:35,119
It's fine.

171
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:36,720
I'm not tired.

172
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:38,839
If you're tired...

173
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,220
You can go back and rest first.

174
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:47,800
How can your sister rest
easy with you like this?

175
00:11:49,800 --> 00:11:51,579
I'd be even more anxious if I weren't here.

176
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,720
Then what do you want to eat?

177
00:11:58,319 --> 00:12:00,399
You haven't eaten anything since yesterday.

178
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:05,560
I don't have an appetite.

179
00:12:09,739 --> 00:12:10,739
Teng Mo.

180
00:12:12,380 --> 00:12:13,760
Have you ever kept a rabbit?

181
00:12:17,100 --> 00:12:18,100
No.

182
00:12:23,619 --> 00:12:24,779
I had two.

183
00:12:27,680 --> 00:12:28,680
People say...

184
00:12:29,380 --> 00:12:30,380
Rabbits...

185
00:12:31,359 --> 00:12:32,359
Are...

186
00:12:33,340 --> 00:12:35,319
Gentle yet cruel animals.

187
00:12:41,199 --> 00:12:42,979
They don't cry out when they're in pain.

188
00:12:43,579 --> 00:12:44,100
When they suffer...

189
00:12:44,579 --> 00:12:45,619
They don't make a sound.

190
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:47,920
When they get sick...

191
00:12:48,579 --> 00:12:49,600
They just endure it.

192
00:12:51,859 --> 00:12:53,720
They endure absolutely everything.

193
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:01,380
So...

194
00:13:03,939 --> 00:13:04,939
By the time...

195
00:13:05,739 --> 00:13:06,739
You realize...

196
00:13:07,279 --> 00:13:08,739
Something is wrong with them...

197
00:13:10,859 --> 00:13:11,760
It often reaches a point

198
00:13:11,761 --> 00:13:13,539
where things are beyond repair.

199
00:13:16,100 --> 00:13:17,100
They won't even

200
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,600
give you a chance to save them.

201
00:13:28,479 --> 00:13:30,319
My sister is that rabbit.

202
00:13:38,380 --> 00:13:39,380
Shixian.

203
00:13:40,460 --> 00:13:41,460
I always thought,

204
00:13:41,699 --> 00:13:42,699
you know?

205
00:13:43,539 --> 00:13:45,020
I always thought

206
00:13:45,399 --> 00:13:46,399
that as long as I

207
00:13:46,640 --> 00:13:47,640
worked hard,

208
00:13:48,359 --> 00:13:50,600
as long as I held on and tried my best,

209
00:13:52,619 --> 00:13:54,239
life would definitely get better.

210
00:13:57,359 --> 00:13:58,520
But now I realize,

211
00:14:00,119 --> 00:14:02,079
I realize there are
always things in this world

212
00:14:02,659 --> 00:14:03,760
that even time

213
00:14:04,659 --> 00:14:07,000
can't change, right?

214
00:14:10,720 --> 00:14:11,720
Teng Mo,

215
00:14:13,939 --> 00:14:15,699
my sister is going to leave me.

216
00:14:25,859 --> 00:14:26,859
Shixian,

217
00:14:27,699 --> 00:14:28,699
actually,

218
00:14:29,380 --> 00:14:31,819
everything in the universe
is made of protons.

219
00:14:32,899 --> 00:14:34,100
We humans are the same.

220
00:14:36,000 --> 00:14:37,000
This world

221
00:14:38,340 --> 00:14:39,600
is just a cycle.

222
00:14:42,779 --> 00:14:44,100
She isn't leaving you.

223
00:14:45,680 --> 00:14:47,680
She's just keeping you
company in a different way.

224
00:14:49,779 --> 00:14:50,779
I don't want that.

225
00:14:51,279 --> 00:14:52,559
I don't want it to be like this.

226
00:14:53,380 --> 00:14:55,180
She won't be a living, breathing person.

227
00:14:57,060 --> 00:14:59,020
She won't hug me when I'm sad.

228
00:14:59,899 --> 00:15:02,100
She won't scold me when I'm wrong.

229
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:03,499
She won't smile at me,

230
00:15:03,500 --> 00:15:04,699
or worry about me.

231
00:15:07,579 --> 00:15:08,779
I don't want her like that.

232
00:15:10,140 --> 00:15:11,979
I don't want her to become like that.

233
00:15:13,800 --> 00:15:16,220
I want her by my side forever.

234
00:15:16,479 --> 00:15:18,220
How could she not be by your side?

235
00:15:20,380 --> 00:15:21,460
When it rains,

236
00:15:24,060 --> 00:15:25,500
it's her feeling sad for you.

237
00:15:27,659 --> 00:15:28,659
The summer breeze

238
00:15:31,319 --> 00:15:32,960
is her blessing to you.

239
00:15:35,260 --> 00:15:36,780
As long as you keep her in your heart,

240
00:15:36,859 --> 00:15:38,220
she will always be by your side.

241
00:15:42,779 --> 00:15:45,260
Don't let your sister spend
her final journey in sorrow.

242
00:15:46,899 --> 00:15:47,899
Okay?

243
00:16:38,579 --> 00:16:39,579
Shixian.

244
00:16:40,340 --> 00:16:41,060
This photo studio

245
00:16:41,159 --> 00:16:42,220
is way too inefficient.

246
00:16:42,819 --> 00:16:43,979
They just gave me the photos.

247
00:17:01,239 --> 00:17:02,239
The patient is awake.

248
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:04,300
She's in fairly good spirits right now.

249
00:17:05,479 --> 00:17:07,159
The ventilator can be taken off for a bit.

250
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:08,738
She said she wants to see you.

251
00:17:08,739 --> 00:17:09,739
Okay.

252
00:17:11,739 --> 00:17:12,739
Shixian.

253
00:17:14,939 --> 00:17:15,939
Shixian.

254
00:17:17,359 --> 00:17:18,359
In a moment,

255
00:17:18,739 --> 00:17:19,779
whatever your sister says,

256
00:17:20,760 --> 00:17:22,060
make sure you remember it well.

257
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:24,860
If you have anything you want to say,

258
00:17:26,699 --> 00:17:27,960
tell her everything.

259
00:18:02,380 --> 00:18:03,479
What's wrong, Shixian?

260
00:18:05,060 --> 00:18:06,500
Aren't you happy to see me?

261
00:18:08,239 --> 00:18:09,239
No, I am.

262
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:12,140
Sis,

263
00:18:15,279 --> 00:18:16,319
I missed you so much.

264
00:18:18,699 --> 00:18:19,699
These past few days,

265
00:18:20,760 --> 00:18:22,200
you've been sleeping the whole time.

266
00:18:23,319 --> 00:18:24,500
You didn't talk to me at all.

267
00:18:27,260 --> 00:18:29,000
Why are you being so clingy?

268
00:18:29,539 --> 00:18:30,920
Like a little kid.

269
00:18:32,159 --> 00:18:34,659
Didn't you use to complain
that I was too strict with you?

270
00:18:40,779 --> 00:18:41,779
Sis,

271
00:18:42,100 --> 00:18:43,100
look.

272
00:18:43,579 --> 00:18:44,699
The photos we took last time

273
00:18:45,300 --> 00:18:47,239
at the studio are ready.

274
00:18:47,859 --> 00:18:48,859
They look so beautiful.

275
00:18:49,800 --> 00:18:50,800
Really.

276
00:18:51,439 --> 00:18:52,439
Look.

277
00:19:15,640 --> 00:19:16,680
They really are beautiful.

278
00:19:18,800 --> 00:19:20,060
Thank you, Shixian.

279
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:23,420
I have no regrets in this life.

280
00:19:24,859 --> 00:19:25,859
Sis,

281
00:19:27,460 --> 00:19:29,220
you're going to get better, right?

282
00:19:30,920 --> 00:19:32,619
You'll slowly get better.

283
00:19:33,159 --> 00:19:34,159
Right?

284
00:19:37,300 --> 00:19:38,300
Maybe.

285
00:19:39,399 --> 00:19:40,579
I won't get better.

286
00:19:46,779 --> 00:19:47,779
Sis,

287
00:19:48,939 --> 00:19:50,539
couldn't you at least lie to me?

288
00:19:52,859 --> 00:19:53,859
Silly child.

289
00:19:56,300 --> 00:19:57,580
Birth, aging, illness, and death

290
00:19:57,640 --> 00:19:59,140
are just a part of life.

291
00:20:00,060 --> 00:20:01,680
You're an adult now.

292
00:20:02,380 --> 00:20:03,899
You need to learn to be strong.

293
00:20:05,579 --> 00:20:07,960
There are many endings in this world

294
00:20:08,439 --> 00:20:09,920
that simply cannot be changed.

295
00:20:10,399 --> 00:20:12,039
You have to learn to accept them.

296
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:15,720
Sis,

297
00:20:18,640 --> 00:20:20,239
will you turn into a star?

298
00:20:23,579 --> 00:20:24,619
I suppose so.

299
00:20:26,399 --> 00:20:27,680
In my entire life,

300
00:20:28,239 --> 00:20:30,399
I've never traveled very far.

301
00:20:31,779 --> 00:20:32,779
From now on,

302
00:20:33,439 --> 00:20:35,739
I want to freely explore a bigger,

303
00:20:36,739 --> 00:20:38,600
wider world.

304
00:20:40,699 --> 00:20:42,159
But this body is too heavy.

305
00:20:42,659 --> 00:20:44,020
I can't take it with me.

306
00:20:44,680 --> 00:20:46,239
I have to leave it behind.

307
00:20:49,159 --> 00:20:49,680
Sis,

308
00:20:50,100 --> 00:20:51,100
But,

309
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,699
I can't bear to let you go.

310
00:20:55,579 --> 00:20:57,119
I can't bear to lose you.

311
00:20:58,220 --> 00:20:59,840
I can't bear to leave you either.

312
00:21:01,699 --> 00:21:03,159
I'm not afraid of dying.

313
00:21:04,779 --> 00:21:06,899
I'm just afraid that after I'm gone,

314
00:21:07,739 --> 00:21:10,279
you'll be too lonely all by yourself.

315
00:21:12,640 --> 00:21:13,640
Sis.

316
00:21:28,060 --> 00:21:29,939
But now you have Teng Mo.

317
00:21:31,039 --> 00:21:32,560
After I'm gone,

318
00:21:33,220 --> 00:21:35,520
you and Teng Mo need to live a good life.

319
00:21:36,579 --> 00:21:38,579
It wasn't easy for the
two of you to get together.

320
00:21:39,439 --> 00:21:41,180
Since you've chosen to be together,

321
00:21:41,460 --> 00:21:43,340
don't give up easily.

322
00:21:44,539 --> 00:21:46,020
No matter what happens,

323
00:21:46,720 --> 00:21:48,500
don't throw childish tantrums.

324
00:21:49,560 --> 00:21:50,819
Don't be foolish.

325
00:21:52,220 --> 00:21:53,220
He spoils you

326
00:21:53,460 --> 00:21:54,819
because he loves you.

327
00:21:57,520 --> 00:21:59,859
You need to treat him
with the same sincerity.

328
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:02,119
Treat him well.

329
00:22:03,899 --> 00:22:05,159
If anything comes up,

330
00:22:05,399 --> 00:22:06,680
talk it over with him.

331
00:22:07,460 --> 00:22:09,500
Don't keep it all bottled up inside.

332
00:22:11,119 --> 00:22:12,500
Communicate with him more.

333
00:22:13,460 --> 00:22:14,460
Got it?
